+// DroidMount: prefix for all device paths. FUSE paths are relative to the
+// mountpoint; the daemon serves them from <devRoot><fusePath> on the phone.
+// Defaults to "/" (upstream behavior: whole device). DroidMount.app mounts
+// with rootdir=/sdcard so the volume is the phone's user storage directly —
